{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Axe Ghost</strong> is an unforgiving turn-based spatial battle against an advancing monster horde. You play cards to manipulate  enemy positions, grouping them up before destroying them in a bid to make your mark on the daily leaderboard.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994110/extras/cards2.gif?t=1745236141\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The weapons dealt let you push, swap, clone, slice, freeze, magnetize and destroy the advancing monsters before they reach the bottom of the grid. Group them cleverly - the more monsters you destroy in a single attack, the more each one is worth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes the Tutorial and three Path to Readiness training stages. Your progress is carried over to the full game, which adds the main <strong>Daily Challenge</strong> mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994110/extras/enemies.gif?t=1745236141\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I hear them approaching.</p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2994110?t=1745236141","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2994110?t=1745236141","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994110/5dc98f23231535f2b872adf41a8b5a55f191c1d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745236141","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994110/5dc98f23231535f2b872adf41a8b5a55f191c1d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745236141","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Axe Ghost</strong> is an unforgiving turn-based spatial battle against an advancing monster horde. You play cards to manipulate  enemy positions, grouping them up before destroying them in a bid to make your mark on the daily leaderboard.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994110/extras/cards2.gif?t=1745236141\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The weapons dealt let you push, swap, clone, slice, freeze, magnetize and destroy the advancing monsters before they reach the bottom of the grid. Group them cleverly - the more monsters you destroy in a single attack, the more each one is worth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes the Tutorial and three Path to Readiness training stages. Your progress is carried over to the full game, which adds the main <strong>Daily Challenge</strong> mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994110/extras/enemies.gif?t=1745236141\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I hear them approaching.</p>","developers":["Tomasz Kaye"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2712670","name":"Axe Ghost"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994110/bbeda9d056ab4bf97777fd20f3e809efb5f2543f/header.jpg?t=1745236141","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> </li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257100834,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100834/movie480.mp4?t=1740592256","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100834/movie_max.mp4?t=1740592256"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c